// Base.xcconfig - build settings for the CameraAccess app target (Debug and Release)
//
// The OpenAI key for cloud reading (A11y/Cloud) is a secret, so it never lives in a tracked file.
// Put it in Secrets.xcconfig next to this file (gitignored; copy Secrets.xcconfig.example). Without
// it OPENAI_API_KEY stays empty, Info.plist's OpenAIAPIKey is empty, and the app reads on the
// phone unless a key is pasted in Settings (stored in the Keychain).
//
// Note: in xcconfig files "//" starts a comment, so a value can't contain it.

OPENAI_API_KEY =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
